# --- Runtime output ---
# --- Match artifacts: TRACKED on purpose -------------------------------------
# The lecturer asks for the logs and the repository of the games themselves, so
# the actual conduct of each match can be verified and followed -- not just the
# four JSON artifacts quoted in the report. These files ARE the evidence: the
# sealed per-step records, the signed declaration, the agreed config and the
# result, for every series we have played. They were ignored here for months,
# which meant a graded counted series existed only on one laptop.
# state/ stays ignored: it is a resume file, not evidence.
state/
*.log

